think of a big, red rhino.

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:11.540
The B stands for
breach notification.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.360
R stands for right of access,
Right to be forgotten,

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:18.020
Privacy by design, as well
